{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaos is terrestrial. The solution\u2026 is the UvU drone.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/145bd551d8f46ec720925f1efe5571b6.webp?t=1771043960\" width=31 height=46 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intergalactic mission went totally wrong! The ET siblings tried to land on Earth, but they ended up getting lost and now they're in the middle of the <i>muvuca</i>! Control the UvU drone and bring order to the chaos in this unique adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Muvuca</i> is a frantic action-puzzle game where your mission is to organize the human mess to find the extraterrestrials who got lost on Earth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/bd69fe92c58961347dbaa4f33310fb67.poster.avif?t=1771043960\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/bd69fe92c58961347dbaa4f33310fb67.webm?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/bd69fe92c58961347dbaa4f33310fb67.mp4?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Otherworldly Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the UvU (Universal Flying Unit), a rescue drone with one single task: to organize! Use your skills to control the crowd and find the lost ETs. Each level is a new challenge of strategy and quick reflexes, with several unique interactions with the human world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/83a12b65f3b4a001adb2c7e6e66cb28e.poster.avif?t=1771043960\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/83a12b65f3b4a001adb2c7e6e66cb28e.webm?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/83a12b65f3b4a001adb2c7e6e66cb28e.mp4?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-Degree Immediate Rescues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rescue operation will travel to the four corners of planet Earth, offering a huge variety of different challenges and ways to play, for you to play alone or with friends.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+50 levels spread across 5 unique scenarios, from the urban jungle to the frozen poles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different ways to play! Test your reaction time, strategy, and your ability to work under pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends in co-op mode to double the chaos (and the fun), or compete in PvP to see who is the master of organization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/5db0e76e26cb8173d3e5aa7d1b72c629.poster.avif?t=1771043960\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/5db0e76e26cb8173d3e5aa7d1b72c629.webm?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/5db0e76e26cb8173d3e5aa7d1b72c629.mp4?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Odyssey on Earth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intergalactic rescue mission went totally wrong! The ET siblings tried to land on Earth, but collided with a satellite and fell right into the middle of the\u2026 <i>muvuca</i>!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your almanac with all the different humans you find along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all the badges by completing all the modes and challenges in each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics with crispy pixels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique soundtrack, the most lively in the galaxy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine, combine, combine!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nonstop, because the Muvuca never stops!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/6d455caf8a0f12d29a94354990693199.poster.avif?t=1771043960\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/6d455caf8a0f12d29a94354990693199.webm?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/6d455caf8a0f12d29a94354990693199.mp4?t=1771043960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Studio Calembur</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950070/extras/5ee8bd64e24ef1e5bce666779766eae1.poster.avif?t=1771043960\" width=128 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps